Optional follower Pokemon (OPTIONS > ENHANCEMENTS > FOLLOWER), on the
HeartGold/SoulSilver sprites and texts the builder puts in the data pack:
it follows, talks, finds items, comes out of and goes back into its Poke Ball,
and walks in through doors behind the player. The visible wild Pokemon (0014)
use the same sprites where the pack has them, keep their places through
battles, menus and map crossings, grow in where they appear, and on FEW or
SOME come on top of the random encounters.
Applies after 0054-pokedex-capture-layout.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

